{"4356840": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Endix", "steam_appid": 4356840, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3811de2b66702b1f58c0645e39dbe78a.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3811de2b66702b1f58c0645e39dbe78a.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3811de2b66702b1f58c0645e39dbe78a.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep up with the latest Endix updates, news, and discussions. Join Discord on the right sidebar ↗️</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Servers are currently offline. Follow Endix for future editions.<br>Thank you for joining us. Endix will return!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDIX is a free multiplayer experience</strong> that puts you inside a real gaming convention, one you can actually walk through, explore, and play from anywhere in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/ab0c301c52ed41fc395962167bfdc969.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/ab0c301c52ed41fc395962167bfdc969.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/ab0c301c52ed41fc395962167bfdc969.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move through themed zones and immersive halls, step inside booths <strong>built with real in-game assets</strong> and go hands-on with demos at your own pace. Show up in style with your own customized character, alone or alongside friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/27bfb7863b234b23599826161f00fd4f.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/27bfb7863b234b23599826161f00fd4f.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/27bfb7863b234b23599826161f00fd4f.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is crafted uniquely by developers to give you an authentic representation of their games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b09c779ab399ba52b4ca852912c2129.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b09c779ab399ba52b4ca852912c2129.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b09c779ab399ba52b4ca852912c2129.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix provides equal opportunities, regardless of your situation, Endix is for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/dba4ee42a7bb1976855e6c99594ff475.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/dba4ee42a7bb1976855e6c99594ff475.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/dba4ee42a7bb1976855e6c99594ff475.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We help you discover new games that might have not been on your radar yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/70af3adb616dc496e36a7db977639c62.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/70af3adb616dc496e36a7db977639c62.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/70af3adb616dc496e36a7db977639c62.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every booth comes with its own theme and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b10d6b5730611afb9bc4a2a417abca8.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b10d6b5730611afb9bc4a2a417abca8.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/2b10d6b5730611afb9bc4a2a417abca8.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix invites you to explore and interact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/9072e3744e05fd6d4bafa8c5d548593b.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/9072e3744e05fd6d4bafa8c5d548593b.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/9072e3744e05fd6d4bafa8c5d548593b.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends or make new ones. Connect with developers and content creators in a space designed to feel alive, not static. No flights. No queues. No ticket prices. Just the energy of a major gaming event, open to everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix offers mini-games you can join and compete in. In our Discord you can pitch your own ideas that we should add to the expo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own avatar and jump into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No borders, no barriers:</strong> Free multiplayer and open to every gamer regardless of where they are in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a game built like an event: </strong>Move through stages and themed areas filled with atmosphere, surprises, and interactive moments that make exploration rewarding and memorable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover what's next:</strong> Play demos, watch trailers, reveals, and exclusive showcases from games you know and new titles you didn't know existed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booths built by developers:</strong> Each booth has its own look, environment, and content <strong>crafted with real in-game assets</strong> by the teams behind the titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community first: </strong>Connect with friends, creators, and developers from around the world in a multiplayer experience built to remove geographic barriers and to bring gamers together. Yes, we have Proximity Chat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your character, your way:</strong> Customize your own avatar with cosmetics, outfits, and accessories before jumping into the world of Endix.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete and win:</strong> Mini-games, contests, leaderboards. Bring friends or make new ones on the way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The developers describe the content like this:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game itself features no violence or gore, there are trailers and gameplay videos for other games that players can view that contain gore and violent scenes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note on Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix is designed to evolve as an interactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content, booths, and features may change over time as part of new in-game events and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Endix account is required</strong> to access the game’s online features.<br><br>We are a start-up working on a new way to experience gaming events globally. Any feedback is highly welcomed and much appreciated.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Servers are currently offline. Follow Endix for future editions.<br>Thank you for joining us. Endix will return!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENDIX is a free multiplayer experience</strong> that puts you inside a real gaming convention, one you can actually walk through, explore, and play from anywhere in the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph