p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/0fd2f382e1aa2c398be1a7c67ff40a2d.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix offers mini-games you can join and compete in. In our Discord you can pitch your own ideas that we should add to the expo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.poster.avif?t=1786645427\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.webm?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/extras/3d177c87b618241e4d06a2e7d3306a8f.mp4?t=1786645427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own avatar and jump into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No borders, no barriers:</strong> Free multiplayer and open to every gamer regardless of where they are in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a game built like an event: </strong>Move through stages and themed areas filled with atmosphere, surprises, and interactive moments that make exploration rewarding and memorable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover what's next:</strong> Play demos, watch trailers, reveals, and exclusive showcases from games you know and new titles you didn't know existed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Booths built by developers:</strong> Each booth has its own look, environment, and content <strong>crafted with real in-game assets</strong> by the teams behind the titles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community first: </strong>Connect with friends, creators, and developers from around the world in a multiplayer experience built to remove geographic barriers and to bring gamers together. Yes, we have Proximity Chat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your character, your way:</strong> Customize your own avatar with cosmetics, outfits, and accessories before jumping into the world of Endix.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Compete and win:</strong> Mini-games, contests, leaderboards. Bring friends or make new ones on the way to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mature Content Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The developers describe the content like this:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game itself features no violence or gore, there are trailers and gameplay videos for other games that players can view that contain gore and violent scenes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Note on Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endix is designed to evolve as an interactive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Content, booths, and features may change over time as part of new in-game events and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Endix account is required</strong> to access the game’s online features.<br><br>We are a start-up working on a new way to experience gaming events globally. Any feedback is highly welcomed and much appreciated.</p>", "short_description": "Explore unique &amp; immersive booths from your favorite games. Watch exclusive trailers, compete in mini-games, and connect with players, creators &amp; developers from around the world. All inside a living, free multiplayer experience.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“Endix isn’t the new E3, it’s better!”<br>Videogamer<br><br>“I obviously couldn’t resist playing a whole lot of demos after checking out the sights and sounds of the convention”<br>Loot Level Chill<br><br>“I didn’t know what to expect when I came across ENDIX, but it wasn’t this. This could genuinely be one of the best ways to help folks from around the world market their games”<br>Vice<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/bd5749a25a866efe2652aac705f3fd8d057a4a0a/header.jpg?t=1786645427", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/2a90e55172c947f53b39819aa31186990b29abae/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786645427", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4356840/2a90e55172c947f53b39819aa31186990b29abae/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786645427", "website": "https://endix-expo.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7600 / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 16 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible sound card<br></li><li><strong>Ad